   MATERIALIZE item_per_order
   SCAN order_items USING INDEX ix_i_order
   SCAN o USING INDEX ix_o_cust
   BLOOM FILTER ON ipo (order_id=?)
   SEARCH ipo USING AUTOMATIC COVERING INDEX (order_id=?) LEFT-JOIN
   SCAN c
